00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:28.320
then it kind of takes care of the rest of these because it will see the failures.

94
00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:31.040
It will see kind of, hey, this task doesn't have enough context.

95
00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.160
And so we need to update our create issues

